PomAROS QEMU - AROS development preview

Open System, Tools, Utilities and Prefs for the standard AROS applications.
QEMU 11 is an external macOS prerequisite, not part of this guest system.
This preview requires macOS 26 or later, matching the tested Homebrew QEMU
11.0.1 executable. The launcher alone targeting macOS 13 is not a claim of
full guest execution on older macOS versions.

This backend has no host clipboard/file bridge or coordinated guest flush/quit
transport. Closing the window or quitting QEMU can interrupt cached writes.
Use an isolated development disk; this preview is not qualified for personal
persistent data. Do not assume that a normal QEMU exit flushed guest files.

Installing the application preserves existing profiles; it does not update an
already initialized guest disk. The immutable seed is used for a new profile.
The guest includes only portable/virtual-device drivers and reviewed fonts.
See the bundled licence notices and corresponding-source release assets.
